+ *
+ * Functions which should be static, regardless of whether or not inline
+ * is available or enabled should use the NETSNMP_STATIC_INLINE macro,
+ * like so:
+ *
+ *    NETSNMP_STATIC_INLINE function(int parm) { return parm -1; }
+ *
